criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Age ≥ 18 and ≤ 80;
* Participants with stage V chronic kidney disease;
* Participants with documented type 2 diabetes AND/OR documented glomerular disease (proteinuria \> 1 g/24 h) AND/OR diagnosed with heart failure as recognized by a cardiologist according to the criteria of the European Society of Cardiology;
* Participants who have and agree to use an internet connection;
* Participants who speak and understand French and are able to complete the questionnaires;
* Participants who have been informed and have signed an informed consent form;
* Participants covered by a social security program.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Inability to use the app (blindness, severe intellectual disability);
* Life expectancy of less than 6 months, as determined by the investigator;
* Significant noncompliance, as determined by the investigator;
* Participants for whom, in the event of end-stage renal disease, palliative care would be chosen over dialysis or transplantation;
* Women who are pregnant or may become pregnant (of childbearing age and not using effective contraception) or who are breastfeeding;
* Persons under legal guardianship (under legal protection or deprived of liberty by judicial or administrative decision);
* A person unable to understand the information related to the study (due to linguistic, psychological, cognitive, or other reasons);
* A participant currently enrolled in another clinical trial or study, or who has participated in another clinical trial or study that could have affected their health status within the 6 months prior to enrollment.
